{
  "id": 88691309,
  "iid": 2124,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "GitHub CI, CMake: override the definition of cmake_build.",
  "description": "Overriding the definition of the rpmbuild macro cmake_build on the\ncommand line, so that it doesn't include the string \"--verbose\", should\nprevent cmake --build from being run with --verbose, and thus prevent it\nfrom running Ninja with the -v flag, and thus prevent a bunch of extra\nnoisy output from being produced for every build command, and thus\nprevent the build log from hitting GitLab's 4MB limit.\n\nUnlike piping the output of \"ninja rpm-package\" to sed, this means that\nthe exit status of \"ninja rpm-package\", rather than the exit status of\nsed, is tested.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-02-16T08:34:18.416Z",
  "updated_at": "2021-02-16T09:43:52.892Z",
